 225:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    Auto-Reload Register at the next update event.
 226:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    This parameter must be a number between Min_Data=0x0000 and Max_
 227:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    Some timer instances may support 32 bits counters. In that case 
 228:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h **** 
