 236:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   uint32_t RepetitionCounter;  /*!< Specifies the repetition counter value. Each time the RCR downc
 237:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    reaches zero, an update event is generated and counting restarts
 238:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    from the RCR value (N).
 239:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    This means in PWM mode that (N+1) corresponds to:
