 241:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                       - the number of half PWM period in center-aligned mode
 242:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    GP timers: this parameter must be a number between Min_Data = 0x
 243:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****                                    Advanced timers: this parameter must be a number between Min_Dat
