2016:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  TIMx Timer instance
2017:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  CounterMode This parameter can be one of the following values:
