2162:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note The counter clock frequency CK_CNT is equal to fCK_PSC / (PSC[15:0] + 1).
2163:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note The prescaler can be changed on the fly as this control register is buffered. The new
2164:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       prescaler ratio is taken into account at the next update event.
2165:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Helper macro @ref __LL_TIM_CALC_PSC can be used to calculate the Prescaler parameter
