2304:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h **** 
2305:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h **** /**
2306:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  Indicates whether dithering is activated.
2307:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_DITHERING_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check whether or not
2308:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       a timer instance provides dithering.
2309:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll CR1          DITHEN          LL_TIM_IsEnabledDithering
