2325:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h **** /**
2326:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  Enable  the capture/compare control bits (CCxE, CCxNE and OCxM) preload.
2327:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note CCxE, CCxNE and OCxM bits are preloaded, after having been written,
2328:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       they are updated only when a commutation event (COM) occurs.
2329:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Only on channels that have a complementary output.
2330:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_COMMUTATION_EVENT_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
