2342:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @brief  Disable  the capture/compare control bits (CCxE, CCxNE and OCxM) preload.
2343:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Macro IS_TIM_COMMUTATION_EVENT_INSTANCE(TIMx) can be used to check
