  13:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *   @version M4_VERSION
  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *            of the DAC component using PWM/TIM modules of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *          
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *            of the DAC component using PWM/TIM modules of theStellar Motor Control:
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *             + Set up the DAC/TIM outputs
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *             + get the current DAC channel selected output.
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *             + Set the value of the "User DAC channel".
  22:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** *             + get the value of the "User DAC channel".
  23:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** */
