  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** /** @defgroup dac_rctimer_ui DAC RC Timer User Interface
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   *
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * @brief RC Timer DAC User Interface implementation
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   *
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * Digital to Analog Converter common component. In Motor Control context, the DAC is used for
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * debug purposes by outputting information with low overhead. It is particularly useful to
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * output fast changing analog-like data as voltage references or measured currents to compare
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * them with measurements made with other means, for instance.
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   *
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * The RC Timer DAC component aims at using a PWM Timer coupled with an RC network as a DAC
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   *
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   *
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   * @{
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c ****   */
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/dac_rctimer_ui.c **** 
